Package: pathwaytheme
Title: Pathway-Level Summaries of Any Omic Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aly", "Abdelkareem", email = "aly@aidachip.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns any features-by-samples omic matrix into a pathway-level
    summary: enrichment (ssGSEA, over-representation, GO-slim) then grouping,
    principal component analysis, optional differential pathway testing and
    category roll-up, and a fixed set of publication figures and tables.  This
    is the R implementation of the PathwayTheme pipeline; it mirrors the Python
    package stage for stage and produces the same tables and figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
